---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="StrapSheets pricing" description="Free with ads, or Pro without ads and with the Custom tool builder.">
  <h1>Pricing</h1>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th></th><th>Free</th><th>Pro</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Twelve standard tools</td><td>Yes</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
      <tr><td>PDF cards and mail</td><td>Yes</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Banner on the session list</td><td>Shown</td><td>Hidden</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Custom tool builder</td><td>Locked</td><td>Included</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Thread names you add</td><td>Locked</td><td>Included</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>Pro is a monthly or yearly subscription. The price is the one on the purchase button. Apple or Google bills it, and it renews until you cancel in that store's subscription settings. Restore Purchases is on the same screen.</p>
</Base>
